From: Teather Project <noreply@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] support virtual DNS over TCP

tun2proxy 0.8.3 handles virtual DNS only for UDP port 53. System resolvers
must be able to retry over TCP when responses are truncated or policy requires
TCP. Intercept TCP port 53 in virtual mode and implement RFC 1035 two-byte
length framing with a bounded 4096-byte query.
---
 src/lib.rs | 85 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 85 insertions(+)

--- a/src/lib.rs
+++ b/src/lib.rs
@@ -66,6 +66,7 @@
 pub mod win_svc;

 const DNS_PORT: u16 = 53;
+const MAX_VIRTUAL_DNS_MESSAGE: usize = 4096;

 #[allow(unused)]
 #[derive(Hash, Copy, Clone, Eq, PartialEq, Debug)]
@@ -300,6 +301,17 @@
